cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study or its code, please cite it as below."
title: "NEM battery dispatch: how much arbitrage survives imperfect forecasts?"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible holdout study of five-minute energy arbitrage by a
  hypothetical 100 MW / 200 MWh battery in South Australia, June 2023 to
  May 2024. It compares a perfect-foresight ceiling, an oracle, rule-based,
  point-forecast and stochastic policies on AEMO's published forecasts, under
  the NEM's fixed daily band prices, with a protocol frozen before the test.
authors:
